# CI builds /template-check/{slug} so the divergence and <bdi> gates have
# HTML to read. Those files must exist on disk. They must not be a second
# public URL for the demo listings — noindex is not enough if the path is
# reachable (the product-gap plan). Cloudflare Static Assets honours this
# file before it serves the asset, so production 404s while the verify
# scripts still open the built files.
/template-check /404 404
/template-check/ /404 404
/template-check/* /404 404
